    "signature": "fn concat_elements_utf8<Offset: OffsetSizeTrait>(left: &GenericStringArray<Offset>, right: &GenericStringArray<Offset>) -> Result<GenericStringArray<Offset>, arrow_schema::ArrowError>",
    "docs": "Returns the elementwise concatenation of a [`GenericStringArray`].\n\nAn index of the resulting [`GenericStringArray`] is null if any of\n`StringArray` are null at that location.\n\n```text\ne.g:\n\n  [\"Hello\"] + [\"World\"] = [\"HelloWorld\"]\n\n  [\"a\", \"b\"] + [None, \"c\"] = [None, \"bc\"]\n```\n\nAn error will be returned if `left` and `right` have different lengths",
